an class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgHomologyGroup}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgHomologyGroup}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}homology\\text{-}group}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcAlgHomologyGroup}_S(H,C,d,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,d)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land H=H_n(C,d)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}homology\\text{-}group}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcAlgHomologyGroup}_S(H,C,d,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,d)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land H=H_n(C,d)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an exact typed bridge to the upstream homology object; cycles, boundaries, and the quotient are supplied by the chain-complex and homology definitions rather than reconstructed with undeclared notation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-homology.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9f6d19a1e737076","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-homology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,d,H,n\\